The multiplicities sum to 96, so the ranks over a field of positive
characteristic, which bound the ranks over Q from below, are met.
The kernel of N is 30-dimensional: the 24 radial directions, on which
P vanishes, and the 6 infinitesimal rotations.  Halving and taking
square roots, the singular values of Lambda on the tangent space are
0, 1, sqrt(5/2), sqrt3, 2 with multiplicities 6, 29, 8, 21, 8.
The smallest nonzero singular value is exactly 1, which is the
constant the radius 2/sqrt(577) of Theorem (a radius for the
rigidity) is built from.
